{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In Wonderland, the evil Red Queen has captured Alice\u2019s friends and she is the only one who can save them!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will Alice be able to sneak into the Royal Castle and free them all?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Alice in Disguise</i></strong> is a <strong>stealth </strong>game with chess-based <strong>puzzles </strong>where you must complete a series of levels without getting caught by enemies. Levels are set on chessboards where Alice must <strong>disguise </strong>herself and act like the castle guards to go unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are <strong>chess </strong>pieces with different movement patterns: so, when disguised as one of them, Alice will move with the corresponding scheme. <strong>Abilities </strong>like resizing, invisibility, and teleporting will help you complete the puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess-based <strong>puzzles </strong>of increasing complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth </strong>sections based on disguises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special <strong>abilities </strong>and effects to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and appealing graphic <strong>style</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Try to rescue all of Alice's friends and defeat the evil Queen to save Wonderland!</i></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432840?t=1750440107","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432840/181df53a40a4faff7df8d3541ac888b8d3efde3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750440107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432840/0e34d001d45a378bc958ae69726fd91f62b84d23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750440107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.ste